      "sha256": "2800826236f1a322e52624196abf86ed3831e263e58b609ab418da2c1d7649bc"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "StereoInstaller now embeds the exact verified files supplied in villain nodes (1).zip and replaces the matching files inside discord_voice while preserving unrelated files. A full original backup is created before replacement and Revert restores it.\n\nAdds persistent per-account VoiceLists actions: محروم مني disconnects a selected member whenever they enter your voice room, and فصل عند تشغيل الكاميرا disconnects them when they enable camera. Both require the signed-in account's server permission and include queueing and rate limits.\n\nAdds the local UserRadar watchlist for visible message, edit, cached delete, typing, voice, camera, stream, presence, profile and shared-server events. It is disabled by default.\n\nEnables the right-click emoji/sticker server picker, retains Token Importer's isolated encrypted vault fixes and Server Cloner safeguards, and includes the current official Equicord and Vencord plugin set.\n\nValidation passed: TypeScript, ESLint, Token Importer regressions, stereo payload hashes, replacement preservation, packaged helper self-check, production build, installer tests, embedded-ASAR verification, and Windows Defender scan."
}

